change('| The new replaces the old — no accumulation. Generated files and caches are deleted at the end of every round |', '| Avoid duplicate working copies. Cleanup applies only to authorised disposable local files after durable evidence is verified; old results, ticks, source data and owner files are preserved. Never silently delete to meet a size limit |')
change('You may plan, analyse, prepare and repair research tooling, run short validation, write papers and reports, audit, and propose.', 'You may plan, analyse, prepare and repair research tooling, run short validation and authorised light registered measurements expected to take at most600 seconds, publish their evidence on work branches, write papers and reports, audit, and propose.')
